If you really want to test service startup, your molecule.yml must use privileged containers.
Example: container with systemd


platforms:
  - name: ns1
    image: geerlingguy/docker-rockylinux9-ansible
    privileged: true
    command: /usr/sbin/init

  - name: ns2
    image: geerlingguy/docker-rockylinux9-ansible
    privileged: true
    command: /usr/sbin/init

